  "Watch the camera while the screensaver is up and wake the screen when someone approaches. The camera runs only during the screensaver.": "settingScreensaverDismissOnMotionDescription",
  "Only when screen is off": "settingScreensaverDismissOnMotionScreenOffOnlyTitle",
  "Keep the screensaver visible when motion is detected while the screen is on. Once the screen turns off, detection wakes the dashboard. Touch still dismisses the screensaver.": "settingScreensaverDismissOnMotionScreenOffOnlyDescription",
  "Postpone screensaver on motion": "settingScreensaverPostponeOnMotionTitle",
  "Delay activating the screensaver when motion is detected. WARNING: Keeps the camera running permanently.": "settingScreensaverPostponeOnMotionDescription",
  "Wake the screen when someone looks at the kiosk, not on movement alone. The camera runs only during the screensaver. WARNING: Needs a lit face; in the dark, schedule motion detection instead.": "settingScreensaverDismissOnFaceDescription",
  "Keep the screensaver visible when a face is detected while the screen is on. Once the screen turns off, detection wakes the dashboard. Touch still dismisses the screensaver.": "settingScreensaverDismissOnFaceScreenOffOnlyDescription",
  "Postpone screensaver on face": "settingScreensaverPostponeOnFaceTitle",
  "Delay activating the screensaver while someone is looking at the kiosk. WARNING: Keeps the camera running permanently, with face detection and its CPU cost on top.": "settingScreensaverPostponeOnFaceDescription",
  "Face sensitivity": "settingFaceSensitivityTitle",
  "Higher wakes on smaller, more distant faces. 1 needs a face close to the screen; 100 reacts to any face the camera can make out.": "settingFaceSensitivityDescription",
  "Show camera preview": "settingFacePreviewTitle",
