  "Preview position": "settingFacePreviewPositionTitle",
  "Which corner the preview sits in.": "settingFacePreviewPositionDescription",
  "Watch the proximity sensor while the screensaver is up and wake the screen when something comes close to the device. A device with only sensors made for calls (\"palm\", \"touch\") will not work.": "settingScreensaverDismissOnProximityDescription",
