  "Delay activating the screensaver while something is close to the sensor.": "settingScreensaverPostponeOnProximityDescription",
  "Read the device's person sensor while the screensaver is up and wake the screen when someone is in front of it. Needs the Log access grant below.": "settingScreensaverDismissOnPersonDescription",
